				<title>SCP-5914</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13932674/scp-5914</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 14 Dec 2020 15:46:24 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>GodlyUser</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>6876114</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p><strong>The &quot;Reaction God&quot;</strong>. This SCP was inspired by some of the reacting fanfiction stories where the characters were gathered by &quot;gods&quot; to watch alternate lives/alternate universes/different realities.</p> <p>As I also edit a few aspects of this &quot;god&quot;, yes, I was also aware of its personality.</p> <p>No, it is not a god. As stated, it belongs to a race of cosmic entities that are superior to gods.</p> <p>And what makes it classified as an Apollyon was that this reaction god can end something that is greater than reality, and a regular universe. It just doesn't have any intentions in doing so, only for now.</p> <p><strong>Fun fact:</strong> Search &quot;The Barrelplex&quot; on google.</p> <p>I mean, I've added &quot;Reaction God&quot; with &quot; for a reason, you know?!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
